orted Qtrly EPS Of $0.39', 'text': 'QTRLY EARNINGS PER SHARE $0.39; QTRLY ADJUSTED. EARNINGS PER SHARE $0.61.QTRLY REVENUE $4.38 BILLION.SEES FY 2019 EARNINGS PER SHARE $2.03-$2.06 .Q3 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $0.52, REVENUE VIEW $4.35 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.9.8 MILLION NET NEW ACTIVE ACCOUNTS IN QUARTER.$179 BILLION IN TOTAL PAYMENT VOLUME IN QUARTER, UP 27%.SEES FY 2019 REVENUE $17.70 BILLION TO $17.76 BILLION.SEES FY 2019 ADJUSTED. EARNINGS PER SHARE $3.06 TO $3.08.FY2019 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $2.97, REVENUE VIEW $17.72 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.'}{'symbol': 'PKI', 'date': '2019-10-24 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'PerkinElmer, Inc. Declares Quarterly Dividend, Payable on February 7, 2020', 'text': 'The Board of Directors of PerkinElmer, Inc. declared a regular quarterly dividend of $0.07 per share of common stock on October 24, 2019. This dividend is payable on February 7, 2020 to all shareholders of record at the close of business on January 17, 2020.'}{'symbol': 'PRGO', 'date': '2019-10-24 18:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Perrigo Company Issues Voluntary Worldwide Recall Of Ranitidine', 'text': 'PERRIGO COMPANY PLC ISSUES VOLUNTARY WORLDWIDE RECALL OF RANITIDINE DUE TO POSSIBLE PRESENCE OF IMPURITY, N-NITROSODIMETHYLAMINE (NDMA) IMPURITY IN THE PRODUCT.PERRIGO COMPANY PLC - RECALL IS BEING TAKEN DUE TO POSSIBLE PRESENCE OF A NITROSAMINE IMPURITY CALLED N-NITROSODIMETHYLAMINE.PERRIGO COMPANY - AFTER REGULATORY BODIES ANNOUNCED RANITIDINE MAY POTENTIALLY CONTAIN NDMA, CO BEGAN TESTING EXTERNALLY SOURCED RANITIDINE API, RANITIDINE-BASED PRODUCTS.PERRIGO COMPANY PLC - ON OCTOBER 8, 2019, PERRIGO HALTED SHIPMENTS OF PRODUCT BASED UPON PRELIMINARY RESULTS.PERRIGO COMPANY PLC - BASED ON TOTALITY OF DATA GATHERED TO DATE, PERRIGO HAS MADE DECISION TO CONDUCT THE VOLUNTARY RECALL.'}{'symbol': 'PNW', 'date': '2019-10-24 19:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Pinnacle West Raises Dividend By 6.1 Percent', 'text': 'PINNACLE WEST INCREASES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND.PINNACLE WEST CAPITAL CORP - RAISES DIVIDEND BY 6.1 PERCENT, OR 18 CENTS PER COMMON SHARE ANNUALLY.'}{'symbol': 'PFG', 'date': '2019-10-24 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Principal Financial Group, Inc. Announces Common Stock Dividend for Fourth Quarter 2019, Payable on Dec. 27, 2019', 'text': 'Principal Financial Group, Inc. announced that quarterly common stock dividend of $0.55 per share for fourth quarter 2019 was authorized by the company’s Board of Directors, bringing the trailing twelve-month dividend to $2.18 per share, a 4% increase compared to the prior year trailing twelve-month period. The dividend will be payable on Dec. 27, 2019, to shareholders of record as of Dec. 3, 2019.'}{'symbol': 'PG', 'date': '2019-10-24 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'The Procter & Gamble Company Presents at IoTC NEXT: The Connected Future Summit, Nov-12-2019', 'text': 'The Procter & Gamble Company Presents at IoTC NEXT: The Connected Future Summit, Nov-12-2019 . Venue: The TimesCenter, 242 West 41st Street, New York, New York, United States. Speakers: Ron Peri, Associate Director, Digital Product Innovation.'}{'symbol': 'PLD', 'date': '2019-10-24 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Prologis, Inc. Presents at UBS Global Emerging Markets One on One Conference, Dec-03-2019', 'text': 'Prologis, Inc. Presents at UBS Global Emerging Markets One on One Conference, Dec-03-2019 . Venue: InterContinental New York Barclay, New York, New York, United States. Speakers: Jorge Girault, SVP, Finance, Kosta Karmaniolas, VP of Investor Relations.'}{'symbol': 'PTC', 'date': '2019-10-24 20:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'PTC Inc Reports Qtrly Earnings Per Share Of $0.08', 'text': "PTC ANNOUNCES FISCAL FOURTH QUARTER 2019 RESULTS; PROVIDES FISCAL 2020 OUTLOOK.PTC INC - AS OF END OF Q4'19 TOTAL CASH, CASH EQUIVALENTS, AND MARKETABLE SECURITIES WAS $327 MILLION.PTC INC QTRLY REVENUE $335 MILLION VERSUS $312.5 MILLION.PTC INC QTRLY EARNINGS PER SHARE $0.08.PTC INC SEES 2020 ARR GUIDANCE OF $1,245 MILLION - $1,280 MILLION.PTC INC SEES 2020 FREE CAS